add('IL-26','Fixed center within 20 ft and line of effect; 20-ft-radius sphere.','Concentration, up to 1 minute.','Automatic acoustic field; no creature save.',
'Adopt the supplied Silence proposal. No sound originates, propagates or is heard within the sphere or crosses its boundary while active. A sound path between two outside listeners also fails when it must traverse the field. Speech-dependent V, audible commands, musical/hearing prerequisites and sound triggers fail according to their actual location/path. Visible signs and valid purely mental techniques remain possible.',
'This is an area acoustic rule, not a permanent Deafened/Silenced record on occupants, thunder immunity, vacuum, lost breathing or suppression of physical impact. A caster outside any blocking field can complete its V before its own new sphere appears and maintain concentration inside afterward; existing silence already covering that V prevents beginning the cast. Overlapping spheres have independent expiries.',
'An automaton with only an audible command channel receives no command through the sphere; a documented visible channel can work. Thunder damage is not reduced merely because no sound is heard.',conflicts=['NEW one-minute concentration operational duration supplies the missing persistence; retain original Instantaneous field.'],proposal='silence',numbers={'rangeFeet':20,'radiusFeet':20,'seconds':60})
