'No new attack, ability increase, repair, permanent value or service/charge refill. A compatible existing magical attachment survives only under its actual host predicates; an incompatible one is inactive while this form lasts, not removed, recharged or rewritten. An explicit immutable/unique magical body remains ineligible. No natural limb, bow, ammunition or entire apparatus transformation. At end restore the original form at its actual location with all spent/damage history retained.',
