add('R3-02','One willing creature within60ft with its actual compatible worn/carried gear.','Concentration, up to1minute.','Automatic conditional Invisible state.','NEW invisibility operates only while every part of the recipient’s occupied body space is in dim light or darkness under actual current illumination. Any bright-lit part suspends this spell’s invisibility; returning wholly to dim/darkness restores it only for the unexpired instance. This source has no Action/attack ending, so none is imported from IL-22 or a class invisibility technique.',
'Apply actual Invisible/known-location and alternate-sense rules. No created darkness, automatic Hide, silence, immunity to illumination or visible gear transfer to an unrelated holder. Gear leaving the original recipient loses this source’s concealment; fresh acquired external objects do not automatically join it. Suppression/lighting transitions never reset duration, resources or another source’s ending window.',
'Attacking in dim light can retain this particular invisibility, while ordinary noise/known location still matters. Stepping partly into bright light suspends it without restarting its minute when darkness is reentered.',numbers={'rangeFeet':60,'seconds':60,'actionEnds':False})
add('R3-03','One quasi-real steed in an unoccupied supported10-ft space within60ft.','1hour; no concentration; one steed.','Automatic creation; movement/control uses the finite companion/mount procedure.','NEW Large quadruped, AC12, HP10, walkingSpeed60ft, normal sight/hearing, saves original casterPB, otherchecks0, no attacks/spells/immunities. Maximum one willing Small/Medium rider and350lb combined rider/cargo/tack actually fitting the body. Its own temporary body weighs1,000lb for actual supports/collisions, not transferable material. No saddle/tack is created; bareback riding is allowed. Mount/dismount within5ft spends half the rider’s current walkingSpeed in movement cost with a legal destination and actual capacity. Rider Speed0 prevents that voluntary maneuver.',
'Use LR-G11 commands/attached phase; no immediate free ride movement on creation and no separate offensive action. A movement command permits ordinary movement and a nonoffensive Dash/Dodge/Disengage only where physically legal, with the actual spent movement budget. Outside initiative record the equivalent repeated actual control/time rather than unlimited unobserved travel; this grants no expedition-rate override. OnHP0/expiry/end it vanishes and riders/cargo remain at actual positions with ordinary support/fall handling. No loot/corpse/fuel, free tack, healing/buffer or identity merge with Summon Spectral Steed.',
'A rider with walk30 spends15ft movement cost to mount. The steed moves only in its actually commanded phase, and its350-lb capacity includes an independently supplied saddle.',numbers={'rangeFeet':60,'size':'Large','spaceFeet':10,'ac':12,'hp':10,'speedFeet':60,'bodyWeightLb':1000,'riderCargoMaxLb':350,'riders':1,'hours':1})
